The Storybook addon now starts in a real `storybook dev`. Storybook hands an addon's preset its own options together with the addon's, and its own `cache` (its file-system cache) reached the native session as the addon's `cache` option, which the session refused, so every story fell back to Storybook's own docgen with "could not start: Failed to convert napi value into rust type `bool`". The addon now reads `cache` only when it is a boolean you set.
//! Prop-type resolver — Phase 3a.
//!
//! Converts `ComponentMapping` (raw collected data) into a fully resolved
//! `ComponentEntry` with `PropType` props.
//!
//! Central design:
//! - `resolve_component` is the entry point (called in parallel per component).
//! - `resolve_collected_type` is the recursive dispatch for `CollectedType → PropType`.
//! - No string parsing happens here — everything is already structured `CollectedType`.
//! - Graceful degradation: every unresolvable type becomes `PropType::Opaque` + a `Diagnostic`.

